ou changed to `_process()` at some point so you may have picked up on this. If this is not the problem you could see if using the Compatibility renderer changes anything. I'm on using Linux + Nvidia and lots of times switching to Compatibility fixes some frametime consistency issues.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3753224133/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]